---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = "建筑用丝网：钢筋网、抹灰网与安全应用";
const description = "建筑施工中丝网应用指南。涵盖混凝土钢筋网、抹灰网、安全屏障和脚手架应用及采购技巧。";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-theme-secondary text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">建筑施工中的丝网</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-theme-muted max-w-2xl">
        除了混凝土加固，丝网在现代建筑中承担着多重角色——
        从抹灰衬底到安全屏障。了解每种
        应用有助于优化材料选择。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 text-sm text-theme-muted">
    <a href="/zh/" class="hover:text-theme-accent">首页</a> / 
    <span>应用领域</span> / 
    建筑
  </nav>

  <article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <!-- Overview -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">建筑应用概览</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        丝网贯穿建筑施工全过程，从基础到饰面：
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>混凝土加固</strong> — 楼板、墙体、预制构件（参见<a href="/applications/concrete/" class="text-theme-accent hover:underline">专项指南</a>）</li>
        <li><strong>抹灰网</strong> — 防止灰泥和拉毛灰开裂</li>
        <li><strong>砌体加固</strong> — 墙拉筋、梯筋、灰缝钢筋网</li>
        <li><strong>安全屏障</strong> — 临边防护、防坠网、护栏</li>
        <li><strong>脚手架</strong> — 作业平台、踢脚板、封闭网</li>
        <li><strong>石笼网</strong> — 挡土墙、水土保持、建筑造型</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Plaster Mesh -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">抹灰与拉毛灰网</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        抹灰和拉毛灰层下的丝网可防止温度变形
        和基层不平整导致的开裂：
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">钢板网（扩张网）</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            带加强筋的菱形扩张钢板。拉毛灰和
            抹灰的传统选择。为灰浆提供牢固的咬合面。
          </p>
          <ul class="text-sm text-theme-secondary space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li>+ 灰浆咬合性优异</li>
            <li>+ 有自支撑（垫高）型可选</li>
            <li>− 较重，价格较高</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">焊接网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            轻型焊接网（通常网孔 25-50mm）。大面积
            和要求较低应用的经济选择。
          </p>
          <ul class="text-sm text-theme-secondary space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li>+ 经济、轻便</li>
            <li>+ 易于裁剪和安装</li>
            <li>− 灰浆咬合性较差</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        <strong>镀锌要求：</strong>室外应用必须采用热镀锌
        网材（最低 Z275 或同等标准），以防止锈渍透过饰面渗出。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Masonry Reinforcement -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">砌体加固</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        丝网可加固砌块墙和砖墙，防止开裂：
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>梯筋</strong> — 两根纵向丝加横向连接丝，置于水平灰缝中。标准宽度：50mm、75mm、100mm。</li>
        <li><strong>桁架筋</strong> — 斜向连接丝构成桁架形状。更大刚度，适合更长跨度。</li>
        <li><strong>墙拉筋</strong> — 连接空腔墙的两叶墙，通常采用直径 3-5mm 镀锌丝。</li>
        <li><strong>灰缝钢筋网</strong> — 洞口上方和楼层处的灰缝中连续铺设网材。</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        标准：砌体灰缝钢筋网遵循 ASTM A951，间距和
        布置要求遵循当地建筑规范。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Safety Applications -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">安全与临时工程</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        建筑工地的丝网用于工人保护和坠落物防护：
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">临边防护</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            焊接网填充板的护栏系统。防止坠落和
            物体坠落。通常高度 1.1m，带踢脚板。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">防坠网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            固定在脚手架上的细目网。阻挡灰尘、碎屑和
            工具。动火作业区可选阻燃型。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">脚手架封闭</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            防雨和防护封闭网。允许在恶劣天气下继续施工，
            同时保护下方行人。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">临时围栏</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            建筑工地周界安防。临时立柱上的
            勾花网或焊接网片。参见<a href="/applications/fence/" class="text-theme-accent hover:underline">围栏指南</a>。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Material Standards -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">建筑材料标准</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-theme-tertiary">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">应用</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">标准</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">关键要求</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-theme">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">混凝土加固</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">ASTM A1064</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">焊点抗剪强度、屈服强度</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">砌体加固</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">ASTM A951</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">丝径、间距、镀层</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">抹灰网</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">ASTM C847</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">重量、筋高、镀层</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">安全屏障</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">OSHA/EN 标准</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">承载能力、高度、网孔尺寸</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Sourcing -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">建筑网材采购</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">按应用分类采购</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            不同的建筑网材通常来自不同类型的工厂。
            混凝土钢筋网来自重型网材生产商；抹灰网来自轻型
            网材专业厂。分类采购可获得最优价格。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">核实镀层规格</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            "镀锌"从电镀（薄，仅室内）到热镀锌
            （厚，可户外）不等。请指定镀层重量（g/m²）或 ASTM 镀层等级。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">规划现场存放</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            网材以紧凑的捆或卷到货。确保干燥存放以防
            过早生锈，尤其是未镀层或薄镀层产品。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Related Pages -->
    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">继续探索</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/applications/concrete/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">混凝土用丝网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">钢筋网片详细规格与标准</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/applications/fence/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">丝网围栏</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">临时和永久围栏方案</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/products/welded-wire-mesh/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">焊接丝网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">建筑级焊接网规格</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/products/gabion-baskets/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">石笼网箱</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">挡土墙与水土保持</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded p-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">需要建筑网材？</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-muted mb-4">发送您的项目规格，我们将为您对接合格的制造商。</p>
      <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block accent-bg hover:accent-bg text-theme-primary font-semibold px-6 py-2 rounded transition">
        提交询盘
      </a>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
